STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE 
BEGIN
    IDS_NOPLAYERSTART_DESC  "There is no player start in the map. To add one, select the Entity (axe) tool, drag the crosshairs to the position you want the player to start at, and press ENTER."
    IDS_MIXEDFACES_DESC     "The solid has a mixed face content. That is, some of its faces are ""non-solid"" - water, sky, sludge, and so on - and some of them are ""solid."" QBSP symptom: ""Mixed face contents in leafnode"""
    IDS_DUPLICATEPLANES_DESC 
                            "The solid contains duplicate planes. It needs to be rebuilt."
    IDS_UNMATCHEDTARGET_DESC 
                            "This object has a 'target' value that isn't matched by a 'targetname' value in another object."
    IDS_INVALIDTEXTURE_DESC "The solid is using an invalid texture. You can fix this error with the ""fix"" button."
    IDS_SOLIDSTRUCTURE_DESC "The solid has invalid structure, probably as a result of vertex manipulation."
    IDS_UNUSEDKEYVALUES_DESC 
                            "The entity contains keyvalues that are not used in its class. You can fix this error with the Fix button."
    IDS_EMPTYENTITY_DESC    "This solid-entity contains no solids. Fixing the error deletes the entity."
    IDS_DUPLICATEKEYS_DESC  "The entity contains duplicate keyvalues. Fixing this error removes the duplicates."
    IDS_SOLIDCONTENT_DESC   "The faces in this brush have different content types."
    IDS_INVALIDTEXTUREAXES_DESC 
                            "The face has a texture axis that is perpendicular to the face, probably caused by rotating an object with texture locking disabled. This could also indicate an invalid face caused by vertex manipulation."
END

